  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/1"/>4. Blessed are You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/2"/>our God, King of the Universe
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/3"/>Who formed man (Adam) in His image,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/4"/>in the image of His likeness;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/5"/>and fashioned for him out of his very self
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/6"/>a building (a wife: Eve) for eternity.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/7"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:sheva_berakhot/asher_yatzar_haadam/8"/>Former of Man.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
